      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>This functions like a regular @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.T8EopYZLT137CsdW]{Net}, except the escape DC is equal to the Clockwork Librarian's Crafting DC. The Clockwork Librarian does not need to use an action to draw a net; it can launch one of its five nets from its shoulder immediately.</p><p>The grabbed creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Escape unless you are adjacent to them, and it can attempt a @Check[type:athletics|dc:25] check to Force Open the net entirely. Once the target is no longer grabbed, the net is unwieldy until refolded with an Interact action with the concentrate trait that requires two hands; if used without being refolded, Grapple checks made with the net take a -2 penalty.</p><p>Make a ranged attack roll against a Medium or smaller creature within 20 feet. On a hit, the target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} and takes a -10- foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escapes}, and on a critical hit, it's also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} until it Escapes. The Escape DC is 25. ([[/act escape dc=25]]) A creature adjacent to the target can Interact to remove the net.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
